WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.340
Do you understand now?

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.400
The power you believe in is meaningless.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:32.630
Our investigation shows that
Knight entered the city from the west.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.680
King, that Knight has mentioned,
is probably the master of this El Dorado.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.270
Take Sophie with you
and confirm the situation.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.060
If a Horror is confirmed,
please eliminate it immediately.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.730
Her brother is missing.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:52.400
Her only guardian was murdered
and she's also being targeted.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.940
I'll make sure to protect her.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:00.930
Take care of the city.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.160
And Luke, while you're at it.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.140
Wretch, did you come back empty handed?

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.170
Where is the girl that King summoned?

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.130
I can't believe you had the gall to return!

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:19.090
Because of you, my plans are ruined.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:27.740
Golden Knight. You fought him?

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.520
So, how was it? His blade.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:35.240
He will soon come here, chasing me.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.700
Did you tell King about this?

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:40.530
There is no need.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.870
Looks like things have
gotten a little troublesome.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:56.300
I won't allow anyone to lay a finger on King.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.860
That form...

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.320
You were considered
the strongest Silver Knight...

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:16.990
Is this the miserable result?!

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.110
I see.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.780
You're Luke, aren't you?

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:25.160
You've grown since I last saw you.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.690
However.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.460
You're still a fledgling.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:11.580
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:16.960
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.630
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.050
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.220
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.390
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.760
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.430
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.470
<i>I can see!</i>

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.480
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.350
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:34.060
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.230
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:40.280
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:46.780
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:53.120
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:57.800
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:01.380
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:33.750
I can't take it anymore!
When will we be attacked next?!

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.870
Please calm down. This isn't a terrorist attack.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.280
We know that this is from
a sudden hurricane that hit us.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.510
It's all right. Nothing more will happen.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.280
It's dangerous here.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.020
Chief!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.690
The vehicles can't make it through!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.480
We need to move all
the debris off the streets!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.160
Got it. I'll send some people over.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.830
Hang in there!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.120
Doctor! Please take care of this one!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.830
He's in bad condition.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.420
His wife is still under the debris.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.830
We'll be sure to get her out,

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.670
so please make sure that they'll meet again!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.750
I understand.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:21.960
I'll go with you.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.220
We need to move the debris enough
to get the emergency vehicles in.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.630
Go gather some people.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.800
Roger.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.970
Let's go!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:51.910
So noisy! Pathetic!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.700
You plan to break window
after breaking city?!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.540
Where's Sword?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.210
He already left.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.170
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:05.420
It not all Luke's fault.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.150
Only, we now open, but no business.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:13.040
Before food expire, you pay and eat all!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.350
Before food expire, you pay and eat--

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.330
I heard you.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.440
Then reply!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.360
Don't think you can ignore
people if you look sad.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.650
Goodness! Parent and
child both so annoying.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:36.080
But, I loved Luke's mama.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.120
I was small, so I don't remember too much.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.270
More Horrors in the city now.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:07.900
Many barrier we put up
in city starting to break.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.570
I'll go look at them.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:18.300
Also, Grandpa tell me to smack you
back into shape if you drag your feet.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:19.910
Need smacking?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.230
No need.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.410
Hey! Are you okay?!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.950
Answer me if you can hear me!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.580
Help... Me...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.210
We're coming for you right now!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.380
Hang in there a little longer!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.130
Where's the back-up?!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:11.840
The chief is heading
your way! A little longer.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.590
It's okay. Just a bit longer!

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.350
What's going on?

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.270
Please lend me a hand!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.390
A child is trapped inside!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.480
That's terrible! I'll help.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.360
Thank you!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.730
Is the child a boy or a girl?

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.690
A girl.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.590
How old is she?

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.000
I believe she's about 10 years old.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.640
That sounds delicious!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.450
H-Huh?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:46.920
Then, I'll pull her out and gobble her up.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:51.170
After I eat you first!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.050
Wh-What was that just now?

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.680
Let's take care of the trapped child first.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.170
Sorry. I'm late. What's the situation?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.080
We just pulled her out, but...

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.370
You idiot!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.670
Don't give up on her!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.460
We'll save you now.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.220
Shit.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.760
Come back... Come back!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.510
Okay! We're taking her out!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.070
Thank you for your help.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.350
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.410
Don't doze off and let food get cold.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.780
Sorry. She has a bad mouth.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:15.490
The Alchemists around us
are all pretty rowdy here.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:16.880
Not at all.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.760
Erasing the public's memory and
controlling the information going well?

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.540
That part is going well.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.380
Luke.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.020
If you're looking for words of advice,
you came to the wrong place.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.190
I have no words to give you.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.450
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:42.530
If you have time to sulk,
then eat, eliminate, sleep!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.590
This, word of advice!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:14.770
Noon tomorrow, we will be holding
a memorial service at the square.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.900
Noon tomorrow, we will be holding
a memorial service at the square.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.860
Looks like the city and
the people have finally calmed down.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.330
Seems so.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:28.160
And so, we'll have you leave the city soon.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:32.460
Thank you for your patronage until now!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.010
Take me with you.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.870
That's what all this training has been for!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:53.270
I still think it's too early for you.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.940
I'll be all right!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:57.820
What our battles are like.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.250
It will be good to show him
sooner than later.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:06.660
It'll be a good way for him to judge
how much more training he needs.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.240
There it is. One's duty, all the way.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.080
So heavy! So shoulder stiffening!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.760
Luke. You want to become stronger, right?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.630
Y-Yes!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.260
Don't get separated, Luke.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.600
Don't worry.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.390
Now that you're on the battle field,

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.480
it's up to you to protect yourself.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:35.800
Yes!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.520
Ouch!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.070
You should listen to me a little, too.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.150
What do you think...

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.860
You're doing to my son?!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.750
M-Mom.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.520
Don't let go...

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.460
...of your sword so easily.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.170
Y-Yes!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.440
This is the one.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.300
Don't interfere, Adelaide.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.030
Yeah. Yeah.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.360
Show me.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.660
Your strength.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.480
There is nothing to gain from you.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.130
Dad!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.290
Don't say stupid things!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.600
This is a forbidden art!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:11.890
The book is forbidden because
no one could control its power until now.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.220
Not just until now!
Even now it cannot be controlled!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.140
A knight must be strong.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:22.190
True justice can only be
ascertained with ultimate strength.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.610
A knight's job isn't to win, but to protect!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:28.280
There's no meaning,
if you step off that path.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:32.240
The strength and power to win,
allows us to protect others.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.870
That kind of thinking is dangerous.
You'll get swallowed up by it.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:43.540
If you're set on this, I'm going to
take that from you and burn it now.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.970
I understand. I'll seal this away.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.790
Will that satisfy you?

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.480
Yeah.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:11.120
Concentrate!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.550
Great job.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.110
Welcome home, Dad!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.710
Go back to your room.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:51.650
--Huh?
--Hurry!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.410
The reason I could
never obtain true strength.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.710
I finally realized it.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.250
I knew I should have burned the damn thing.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:13.130
My pure desire for strength,

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.590
continues to be shackled down by this place.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.560
I'll take responsibility for this.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:27.240
Adelaide, if I free myself from you...

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:33.050
I'll be able to reach newer heights.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.210
Christopher Harden!

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.660
You're going to shoot me?

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:43.500
I am.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.050
I was enamored to that part of you.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.310
Mom!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:20.970
Mom!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:22.790
Mom!

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.250
Mom! Mom!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:29.390
--Thank you for becoming
a part of my growth.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:31.250
--Mom! Mom! Mom! Mom!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.210
Mom! Mom!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.170
Mom!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.470
I heard that one of the buildings
he entered suddenly collapsed.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.960
He was such a courageous man.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.060
You idiot!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.630
Don't give up on her!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.250
Come back...

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.650
Okay! We're taking her out!

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:43.240
Mommy told me that you all
were the ones who saved me.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.240
Thank you.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.070
Luke.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.190
Just one thing...

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:18.730
You have to remember this no matter what.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:23.950
True strength isn't something
you obtain for yourself.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:29.550
It's something you obtain for others. Okay?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.170
For others...

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:44.760
The strength I need isn't
the strength to beat him.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.310
It's to protect others from him.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:53.630
What have I been doing until now?

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:00.950
Sorry, Mom...

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:06.990
<i>Jiāyóu</i>.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.450
<i>Jiāyóu</i>, Luke.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.790
<i>Jiāyóu</i>.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.290
I'll leave the city to all of you.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:17.040
Goodness, don't you know
that I'm already too old for this?

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.960
One should get more spirited with age.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:24.170
That quick mouth of yours
is definitely from Adelaide.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.300
It can't be helped.
We'll take care of things.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:29.890
I'm depending on you.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:32.060
Well, go and try your best.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.140
Meifang. I have a request for you.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:42.690
Then, I go!

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:43.460
Yeah!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:50.870
<i>Sān, èr, yī, tuìsàn</i>!

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:41.250
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:45.710
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:50.090
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:54.390
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:54.390 --> 00:23:02.980
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:10.610
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:12.530
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:28.470
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.010
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:41.230
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:48.440
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
